Generic single-database configuration with an async dbapi.
Implementation plans, metrics inventory, and requirements details: `docs/project.md`, `docs/metrics-inventory.md`, `docs/roadmap.md`.

Adding a revision: also add its id to `internal/api/health/schema_revisions.go`.
The Go api's `/health` accepts a database only at a revision that set lists,
so without the entry Go reports Postgres `down` for a database at the new
revision. The live revision oracle (`TestSchemaRevisionsMatchLivePythonAlembic`,
run by `ci/check_go.sh live-python-oracles`) compares that set with this
directory's Alembic chain. When the entry is missing, CI turns red and names
the missing id.
